                                                "sense_id": "2ab9ca07-dc23-3fc1-b21a-c7ac643c40d9",
                                                "text": "These new puritans have turned out to be surprisingly unskilled and inexperienced - very different from my generation who invented wife-swapping, orgies and free love in the late Sixties and early Seventies."
                                            }
